# Conformance probe pack for malformed input on the `json` wire
# (spec/vector-format.md, "Malformed input"). Public. No kinds. The vectors
# cut a message inside each construct and nest objects to the depth limit and
# one level beyond it.
format  conformance-malformed-json
version 0.1.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md and spec/vector-format.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    json
field   uid       id       string
field   lat       pos.lat  float
field   callsign  label    string
